WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:05.610
acts as a guide for a conducted tour of&nbsp;
the renovated white house pointing out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:10.800
a change he himself suggested the removal&nbsp;
from the floor of the national emblem to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.990
wall where it wouldn't be trod upon&nbsp;
every nook and cranny of the newly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.670
refurbished Executive Mansion is visited&nbsp;
by the tourists with mr. Truman as proud&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:26.610
as a newlywed groom showing off his first&nbsp;
home to his Bachelor acquaintances every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:31.890
repair is carefully explained by the chief&nbsp;
executive with the why and wherefore and a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:36.660
lot of the history of each of the famous rooms&nbsp;
is recalled for the edification and education&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:53.950
of the visitors and to top it off the president&nbsp;
entertains with Mozart's ninth Sonata thank you

